      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The museum's new building has expanded the collection of historical material and artifacts that concern the history of the Town of Edwards.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.edwardsny.com/edwards-history-and-genealogy-center",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Edwards Historical Association also produces a quarterly newsletter and publishes books about the local history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://museumsdatabase.com/museums/view/21841",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Farming has been a major factor in this town and for over 200 years where milk, cheese, butter, maple syrup, pork and beef were vital.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.edwardsny.com/edwards-history-and-genealogy-center",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town was organized by legislature on April 7, 1827, after settlers arrived in 1812 and a Scottish influx in 1819.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.edwardsny.com/edwards-history-and-genealogy-center",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The Edwards Historical Association collects and preserves artifacts and memories of Edwards, then shares them through museum visits, meetings, and cultural events.",
